  "description": "Kwon Woo-jae and Baek Yu-hyun became family through their parents' remarriage.\n\nGrowing up relying on each other in a cold home, the two begin a secret relationship they cannot tell anyone about, sparked by their first kiss.\n\nHowever, a sudden separation leaves Woo-jae with resentment and Yu-hyun with longing...\n\nTen years later, the two reunite in an unexpected place.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/justfamily)",
